sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Cloud Tasks
  participant A1 as Attempt 1
  participant A2 as Attempt 2
  participant FS as Firestore
  participant G as Cloud Storage
  participant BQ as BigQuery
  participant RC as Reconciler
  T->>A1: Deliver job ID
  A1->>FS: Claim attempt 1, lease 60 s
  A1->>G: Slot 1 saved
  A1->>BQ: SLOT_SAVED slot 1
  A1--xA1: Crash
  Note over FS: Heartbeat stops, lease expires
  T->>A2: Retry delivery
  A2->>FS: Claim attempt 2 (lease expired)
  A2->>BQ: Read saved plan and slots
  A2->>G: Generate only missing slots (max 2 calls each)
  A2->>BQ: COMPLETED
  A2->>FS: Release lock
  Note over A1,FS: A late write from attempt 1 is rejected - stale attempt
  Note over RC: Every 2 min via Cloud Scheduler
  RC->>FS: Find expired leases and stuck QUEUED jobs
  RC->>G: Recovery scan of reserved paths
  RC->>BQ: Append missing SLOT_SAVED or FAILED interrupted
  RC->>FS: Release lock when terminal
